        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D05-K250, Rope Trafalgar 2-3/4 x 11 Entrance Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Trafalgar Entry Set features a detailed rope design along the edge. A long-time classic the Rope Trafalgar 2-3/4 x 11 Entrance Set is both beautiful and well-made. This is a single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turn knob on interior while a knob or lever operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior the interior. Choose your favorite finish color option and time lever or knob. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a lever/knob operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside,  a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Trafalgar Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Interior and Exterior Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior and Exterior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and trim latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Trafalgar Entry Set",
                "description": "The Trafalgar Entry Set features a detailed rope design along the edge. A long-time classic the Rope Trafalgar 2-3/4 x 11 Entrance Set is both beautiful and well-made. This is a single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turn knob on interior while a knob or lever operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior the interior. Choose your favorite finish color option and time lever or knob.",
